      "body": "ACK [1d19cca](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36404/commits/1d19cca0761ab35eb46867df2aacdc9715fa5ae0)\r\n\r\nNormally this wouldn't fail but in maflcko's nightly build there is this check that causes the test to fail\r\n```\r\ng_ever_used_g_prng |= g_used_g_prng; // after each input\r\n\r\nif (tested && !g_ever_used_g_prng && g_seeded_g_prng_zero) {\r\n    Assert(false); // remove unused SeedRandomStateForTest(SeedRand::ZEROS)?\r\n}\r\n```\r\n[Link to this code](https://github.com/maflcko/bitcoin-core-with-ci/blob/2601-nightly-qa-mutations/src/test/fuzz/fuzz.cpp#L278-L280)\r\n\r\n\r\nNontheless this change makes sense because we do not need `SeedRandomStateForTest(SeedRand::ZEROS);`",
